# Follower parameters - hold station 20 m north of the leader.
#
# Verified against the FOLL_ definitions in this ArduPilot tree. Load onto a
# FOLLOWER only; the leader needs none of these (FOLL_ENABLE stays 0).
# On the real aircraft these load through Mission Planner unchanged.
#
# OFS_TYPE is deliberately 0 (North-East-Down) rather than heading-relative:
# the built aircraft have no compass wired, so leader heading is not
# trustworthy enough to rotate a formation around. The consequence is that
# this offset stays compass-aligned and does not swing as the leader turns.

FOLL_ENABLE      1
FOLL_SYSID       1
FOLL_OFS_TYPE    0
FOLL_OFS_X       20.0
FOLL_OFS_Y       0.0
FOLL_OFS_Z       0.0
FOLL_ALT_TYPE    1
FOLL_YAW_BEHAVE  0
FOLL_DIST_MAX    1000
FOLL_POS_P       0.1
FOLL_TIMEOUT     3.0
